  "notes": "{凍|こお}る means to freeze, to become frozen.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: ⟦{自動詞|じどうし}→自動詞：10977_jidoushi⟧ (intransitive)\n- Causative: {凍|こお}らせる (to freeze something)\n\nASPECT (ている):\n{凍|こお}っている indicates a frozen state: ⟦{水|みず}→水：02258_mizu⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{凍|こお}っている (the water is frozen).\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- ⟦{水|みず}→水：02258_mizu⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{凍|こお}る: water freezes\n- ⟦{湖|みずうみ}→湖：00867_mizuumi⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{凍|こお}る: the lake freezes\n- {凍|こお}りつく: to freeze solid\n- ⟦カチカチ→カチカチ：05719_kachikachi⟧に{凍|こお}る: to freeze rock-hard\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- ⟦{氷|こおり}→氷：02753_koori⟧: ice\n- ⟦{冷凍|れいとう}→冷凍：11730_reitou⟧: freezing (for food preservation)\n- ⟦{冷凍庫|れいとうこ}→冷凍庫：14721_reitouko⟧: freezer\n- ⟦{凍結|とうけつ}→凍結：09613_touketsu⟧: freezing (roads), also 'freeze' (of accounts)\n\nFIGURATIVE:\n- ⟦{血|ち}→血：01659_chi⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{凍|こお}る: blood runs cold (from fear)\n- ⟦{場|ば}→場：03699_ba⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{凍|こお}る: the atmosphere freezes (awkward silence)",
